<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Italiano con Sara 🌸 — Imperativo Gentile</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,300;0,600;1,300&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root { --sand: #f5efe6; --terracotta: #c4714a; --sea: #4a7f8f; --dark: #2a2018; --warm: #e8d9c4; --correct: #5a9e6b; }
  body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--sand); color: var(--dark); margin: 0; }
  .header { background: var(--dark); color: var(--sand); padding: 2.5rem 2rem; position: relative; }
  .header h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 300; }
  .header h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terracotta); }
  .container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  .theory-card { background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--warm); box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(42,32,24,0.05); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .ex-card { background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.8rem; border: 1px solid var(--warm); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  input { border: 2px solid var(--warm); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.5rem; width: 100%; max-width: 250px; outline: none; }
  button { background: var(--terracotta); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px; }
  .feedback { margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 500; display: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <div style="color: var(--sea); letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">LEZIONE 13 APRILE</div>
  <h1>Istruzioni di<br><em>sicurezza</em></h1>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="theory-card">
    <h2>⚓ L'Imperativo di Cortesia (Lei)</h2>
    <p>Per dare ordini gentili ai clienti in barca, usiamo la forma "Lei":</p>
    <ul style="line-height: 2;">
      <li><strong>Si sieda</strong> (da Sedersi - -ARE diventa -A)</li>
      <li><strong>Si tenga</strong> (da Tenersi - -ERE diventa -A)</li>
      <li><strong>Entri</strong> (da Entrare - -ARE diventa -I)</li>
      <li><strong>Faccia attenzione</strong> (da Fare)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="ex-card">
    <p><strong>Esercizio:</strong> Come dici al passeggero di sedersi alla poppa?</p>
    <p>"Per favore, <input type="text" id="ans1" placeholder="..."> alla poppa."</p>
    <button onclick="check()">Controlla</button>
    <div id="fb1" class="feedback"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function check() {
  const a = document.getElementById('ans1').value.toLowerCase().trim();
  const fb = document.getElementById('fb1');
  fb.style.display = "block";
  if(a === "si sieda") {
    fb.innerHTML = "✅ Bravissima Sara! 'Si sieda' è corretto.";
    fb.style.color = "var(--correct)";
  } else {
    fb.innerHTML = "❌ Riprova! Suggerimento: (Lei) si sied... ";
    fb.style.color = "red";
  }
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
